2. Developer fee

The Software includes a disclosed 1% developer fee. It targets a 99:1
allocation of productive device-mining time between the user's configured
public Pearl payout address and this developer payout address:

prl1pr2530rjgquj97eff32j5pzlfw4qzkasl0t0acdx4hc5k498j770qjmzcuz

Startup and idle time are excluded from that accounting basis. The fee does
not promise an exact percentage of uptime, submitted or accepted shares,
rewards, or earnings. You may stop using the Software at any time. You may not
disable, evade, redirect, or tamper with the developer fee or its accounting.

